# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lab runtime artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Generated containerlab topology, per-device configs + the per-lab runtime dir
# (generated/clab-neops-lab). Everything under here is rebuilt from topology.json
# by `./gen_clab_topology`; the runtime dir also holds containerlab-minted TLS
# private keys, which must never be committed.
generated/
# containerlab runtime from the ad-hoc probe (clab/probe.clab.yml)
clab-*/
# Dev-only RSA keypair for the CMS, minted by `make lab-jwt`.
cms/jwt/
# CMS API key minted by `make local-env-init`.
cms_api_key.env

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python bytecode and caches
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

